# Landing known issues → solutions (must)

Patterns below apply to **any** landing (any brand/route). FORJD was the source of truth for these rework bugs. **Do these first** so sections do not get rebuilt 3–5 times.

## 0. Before any section code

| Check | Solution |
| --- | --- |
| Which section + route? | Name it; do not assume Home layout for other landings |
| Asset list? | Read `public/*/SECTION-GUIDE.md` + `asset-manifest.json`; map paths into `@/config/brand` |
| Icon tone? | Dark bg → `light`/`gold`; cream → `dark`; hover cream→gold when both exist |
| Columns in screenshot? | Count L / Mid / R **before** writing JSX |

## 1. Structure mismatch (Hero / Science / Story)

**Issue:** First pass looks “close” but orbit icons, trust bar, or 3-col grid are wrong → user sends fix images.

**Solution:**
1. Sketch columns on paper (or comment block) matching screenshot
2. Place absolute / orbit items with % or polar math, not stacked flex “near” the product
3. Trust/stats bars: close under content (`mt-6`/`mt-7`), floating strip over photo when designed
4. Never claim done until screenshot column count matches

## 2. Wrong background / left visual (Science + Story)

**Issue:** Section bg or left image “matching nahi” (wrong file, hard cream wall, opaque plate).

**Solution:**
- Layered bg only: solid/gradient base → image at low opacity → content `z-10`
- Soft mist overlays; **no hard cream/white panel** that kills the photo on one side
- Prefer transparent cutouts / science pack assets over Lucide guesses
- Sample corner pixels if logo/bg must blend (`visual-fidelity.mdc`)

## 3. Product cards uneven

**Issue:** Taglines, badges, prices, CTAs not on one baseline; cards different heights.

**Solution:**
- Card: `h-full flex flex-col`; image `aspect-*` shared
- Optional badge: reserved min-height placeholder
- Price + CTA block: `mt-auto`
- Equal padding; tight gaps (`gap-4`–`gap-6`)

## 4. Story / values / plaque / stats

**Issue:** Values column too wide, plaque too narrow, stats cells uneven, icons in wrong place.

**Solution:**
- Match screenshot **widths** (fr / max-w), not equal 1/3 by default
- Stats: shared vertical borders; last cell may have **no** bg image if design is script-only
- First/last stats cell alignment: use `justify-end` / `justify-start` as designed
- Icons: brand SVG pack circles (52–58px), consistent

## 5. Testimonials / Journal glass panels

**Issue:** White parent card, Trusted Worldwide trapped inside, cream wash blocking mountain.

**Solution:**
- Parent: cream wash / glass **without** opaque white shell
- Mountain/photo can show through banner where designed
- “Trusted Worldwide” (or similar strip) = **sibling outside** parent card, full-bleed
- Metrics: vertical borders only; last cell often transparent for script + vertical words
- Journal top banner: same pattern (glass + mountain bg-image when designed)

## 6. Newsletter vs Footer confusion

**Issue:** Building “Stay Connected” as a page section instead of footer.

**Solution:**
- **Stay in the Loop** → `components/home/Newsletter.tsx` (`#newsletter`)
- **Stay Connected** → **is the Footer** (`layout/Footer.tsx`): CTA band + link columns + Local Impact + legal
- Wire: `… → Newsletter → Footer` in thin `page.tsx`

## 7. Forms / icons / assets paths

**Issue:** Missing form folder, wrong map extension, Lucide social icons, broken public CSS import.

**Solution:**
- Newsletter: `react-hook-form` in `components/forms/NewsletterForm.tsx`
- Social: project `social-*` SVGs (or `SocialIcons`), not Lucide brand icons
- Verify both `.webp` and `.png` with `Test-Path` before hardcoding
- Do **not** `@import` from `public/` into CSS; put tokens in `globals.css` / `brand.ts`

## 8. Copy + motion noise

**Issue:** Em/en dashes; same enter direction everywhere; missing hover/`cursor-pointer`.

**Solution:**
- Spaced hyphen ` - ` or commas/periods only
- Enter: left copy from left, right visual from right, lists stagger
- Every interactive control: icon (when useful) + hover + `cursor-pointer`

## 9. Header / mobile nav overflow

**Issue:** Icons + Shop Now on phone; hamburger clipped; menu panel overflows or clips.

**Solution:**
- Mobile: logo + hamburger only; wrap icon groups in `hidden md:flex` / `hidden xl:block`
- Do not rely on `hidden` alone when child has `inline-flex`
- Mobile menu: portal to `body`, fixed full width, measure header height; no `100vw`
- Body scroll lock + scrollbar `paddingRight` gap
- See `header-nav.mdc`

## 10. Hero CTA hover dead

**Issue:** Shop Colostrum (or primary) hover not firing.

**Solution:**
- Swiper `effect="fade"` slides steal pointer events over CTAs
- Swiper: `pointer-events-none` + active slide `pointer-events-auto`; CTA row `relative z-30`
- Primary hover CSS under `@media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine)` to avoid sticky gold on touch

## 11. Section eyebrow / title “hidden”

**Issue:** “Our Products”, “Real Stories. Real Change.”, Journal label missing or under sticky nav.

**Solution:**
- Always render design eyebrow + `flex-1` rule line when screenshot shows it
- Split stacked headlines to match requirement lines (`Real` / `Knowledge` / gold line)
- Section: `scroll-mt-24` + enough `pt-*` so label is not under fixed header
- Present vs requirement images: label which is which; match requirement copy/CTA color/script underline

## 12. Sticky nav too late

**Issue:** Navbar stays transparent too long.

**Solution:** Activate frosted/cream bg at `scrollY > ~64`, not when `#hero` fully exits (`scroll-chrome.mdc`)

## 13. Favicon cream / grey box in tab

**Issue:** Browser tab shows a light rectangle behind the mark.

**Solution:** Rebuild icons on **transparent** square (not cream pad); strip baked black plates if needed (`favicon-brand.mdc`). Hard-refresh tab cache.

## 14. Hydration + Image console spam

**Issue:** TypeWriter caret mismatch; `quality` not in `images.qualities`; logo aspect warning.

**Solution:** See `hydration-safe.mdc` (mounted gate, qualities array, `width: "auto"`).

## 15. Wrong port / worktree vs main

**Issue:** `localhost:3124` looks correct but `:3000` does not.

**Solution:** Identify which worktree serves the good port; sync **those** files into main. Do not assume the first BoN winner was applied.

## 16. Mobile cards too large

**Issue:** Product / story / journal cards dominate the phone viewport.

**Solution:** Shorter media heights on base breakpoint; `max-w-md` + center for single-column cards; Swiper `slidesPerView` ~1.2+ so next card peeks.

## Done (every section)

- [ ] Screenshot columns / gaps match
- [ ] Assets from brand + SECTION-GUIDE (no invent)
- [ ] 320 → 1280+ no horizontal scroll
- [ ] Icons + hover + motion
- [ ] `npm run build` if claiming done

